        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" vertex="1" value="PK primary key    UQ unique and NOT NULL&#10;FK foreign key    NN NOT NULL&#10;Arrow: FK to referenced primary key&#10;&#10;Partial unique indexes&#10;One checked_in reservation per room&#10;One non-cancelled successor per predecessor&#10;&#10;Planned overlap needs the service Room lock protocol.&#10;Email and phone are not unique.&#10;ReservationAudit links each application event to its reservation and optional staff identity." style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;">
